{"id":"auteur","lemma":"auteur","pos":"noun","rank":2182,"glosses":["author","composer, artist","inventor (of discovery); perpetrator (of crime); leader (of rebellion etc.)"],"ipa":"/o.tœʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6d/Fr-auteur.ogg/Fr-auteur.ogg.mp3","gender":"mf","forms":{"plural":"auteurs","feminine":"autrice"},"formAudio":{"auteurs":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/43/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-auteurs.wav","autrice":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/13/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-autrice.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Qui est votre auteur préféré ?","en":"Who is your favorite author?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"your, belonging to you"},null,{"g":"favourite"}]},{"text":"Es-tu l'auteur de ce livre ?","en":"Are you the author of this book?","words":[{"g":"are","l":"être"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"book"}]},{"text":"Qui est l'auteur de cette histoire ?","en":"Who's the author of this story?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"story"}]},{"text":"Je lis beaucoup d'auteurs modernes.","en":"I read a lot of modern authors.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"lily"},{"g":"much, very much, a lot"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"modern","l":"moderne"}]},{"text":"Je connais l'auteur.","en":"I am acquainted with the author.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"connaître"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}